1 (B6) \nPyridoxaleHCI \nRiboflavin (BJ \nThiamineXC1 (BI) \nCyanocobalamin (BJ \nCalciferol (D3) \nMenadione3 H,O (K,) \nL-u-tocopherol (E) \nRetinol (A) \nInositol \nCholine \nCholesterol \n0.06 pM \n1.50 pM \n3.00 pM \n9.00 pM \n0.04 pM \n9.40 pM \n0.90 pM \n5.40 pM \n1.00 pM \n0.56 pM \n0.34 pM \n4.00 pM \n0.05 pM \n0.01 pM \n0.01 pM' \n0.07 @vl \n0.25 pM \n24.0 pM \n0.10 pM \nFe(NO,),-9 H,O \nNa2HP0, \nNaHCO, \nKEI,PO, \nGlucose \nHemin \nHEPES \nSodium acetate \nD-ribose \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n48\n\nSerum component represents an imperative goal (https://theses.gla.ac.uk/9136/1/2018NayakPhD_final3.pdf)\nciteturn45search16 [wordlim: 200] Published: 8.5 years ago; Crawled: 8.3 years ago; A study by Merlen et al. (1999) formulated the completely defined medium (CDM/LP) composition for *Leishmania* which showed similar proteinase and antigenic profiles compared to parasites cultured in serum containing medium (Merlen et al., 1999). The medium components included glucose, amino acids and organic salts, ATP, many nucleosides and nucleotides, guanine and hypoxanthine, several vitamins, cholesterol, glutathione, Tween 80, five carbon ribose sugars.\n48\n\nSerum component represents an imperative goal for hemoflagellate cultivation. Serum derived components such as fatty acid free bovine serum albumin, bovine alpha-2 macroglobulin and bovine beta-lipoprotein have been used as serum replacing components (Steiger and Steiger, 1977).\n\nA study by Merlen et al. (1999) formulated the completely defined medium (CDM/LP) composition for *Leishmania* which showed similar proteinase and antigenic profiles compared to parasites cultured in serum containing medium (Merlen et al., 1999). The medium components included glucose, amino acids and organic salts, ATP, many nucleosides and nucleotides, guanine and hypoxanthine, several vitamins, cholesterol, glutathione, Tween 80, five carbon ribose sugars. Some of these components in the medium were thought to be dispensable; since evidence from gene and protein expression studies have highlighted that promastigotes encode for several biosynthetic pathways, for example, exogenous sources of glutathione or cholesterol could be dispensable (Beach et al., 1979, Romao et al., 1999). --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDOF - Diario Oficial de la Federación (https://dof.gob.mx/nota_detalle.php%3Fcodigo%3D756295%26fecha%3D17/01/2005)\nciteturn45search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 21.8 years ago; Crawled: today; CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 259030 COMPLAN, POLVO SABOR CHOCOLATE, BOTE DE 400 GR, LAB. HEINZ MEX 94.25 PZA.\n MEAD JOHNSON 104.65 PZA. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 259018 VITAMINAS Y MINERALES, 3a. EDAD, 90 CAPSULAS, LAB. GELCAPS 100.00 FCO. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 259029 ENSURE, SABOR VAINILLA, LATA DE 400 GR 148.50 PZA. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 259030 COMPLAN, POLVO SABOR CHOCOLATE, BOTE DE 400 GR, LAB. HEINZ MEX 94.25 PZA. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 260007 PATECTOR, AMPOLLETA DE 1 ML, LAB. APLICACIONES FARMACEUTICAS 47.70 PZA. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 260021 TROJAN, CLASICO, CON 3 PIEZAS 22.60 PAQ. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 263011 VIAGRA, 1 TABLETA DE 100 MG, LAB. PFIZER 138.60 CAJA CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 266010 MERTHIOLATE, TINTURA ROJA, BOTELLA DE 60 ML 20.40 PZA. CAMBIO DE MARCA 01 269020 GENERAL 150.00 SERV. CAMBIO DE MODALIDAD 01 272004 LIMPIEZA DENTAL SENCILLA 180.00 SERV. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 273004 RAYOS X DE MANOS, AP Y LATERAL 280.00 SERV. CIERRE DE FUENTE DE INFORMACION 01 275002 EXAMEN GENERAL DE ORINA 70.00 SERV. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCultivation of Clinically Significant Hemoflagellates (https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC118086/)\nciteturn45search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 24.4 years ago; Crawled: last week; Defined 